\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nR_G\\coloneqq\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^2:\\alpha\\Rrightarrow_G\\beta\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\nR_G\\coloneqq\\{(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in((V\\cup\\Sigma)^*)^2:\\alpha\\Rrightarrow_G\\beta\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rrightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}(R_G),\\qquad L_{\\mathsf{UG}}(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\langle S\\rangle\\Rrightarrow_G^*w\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unrestricted\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\alpha\\Rrightarrow_G^*\\beta\\leftrightarrow(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*}(R_G),\\qquad L_{\\mathsf{UG}}(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\langle S\\rangle\\Rrightarrow_G^*w\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>用不同箭头保留与 CFG 字符左部接口的区别。重写可发生在任意有限上下文中；语言只收集终结词，允许中间长度增长或缩短。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-unrestricted-grammar","status":"resolved","id":"5341f44ba0b06e12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-unrestricted-grammar]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d